module Compiler.Binding

// Stage 1 self-hosted binder (name resolution). This first slice builds a
// top-level declaration symbol table from a parsed `DeclarationList` and answers
// name lookups and redefinition checks. Later slices resolve type/value
// references and build scoped symbol tables for function bodies.
//
// Names are compared by their source text via `Compiler.Lexing.TokenTextOf`, so
// the binder is given the source alongside the token stream. Storage uses
// `dynamic` columns, matching the parser (and avoiding the cross-package
// `List<T>` drop gap noted in ROADMAP.md).
